   21                PERFORM 1000-MOSTRAR-MENU
   22             ELSE
   23                IF EIBAID = DFHPF3
   24                   PERFORM 9000-TERMINAR
   25                ELSE
   26                   PERFORM 2000-ELEGIR-OPCION
   27                END-IF
   28             END-IF.
